     6	## Cross-CLI comparison (the one-glance table)
     7	
     8	| Property | codex 0.144.3 | opencode 1.17.18 | agy 1.1.4 |
     9	| --- | --- | --- | --- |
    10	| Prompt argument | positional (or stdin) | **positional** (`-p` = basic-auth *password*!) | `-p "<PROMPT>"` — **must be last arg** |
