   211	## agy — Antigravity CLI (verified v1.1.4, 2026-07-22)
   212	
   213	### Dispatch
   214	```bash
   215	# -p "<PROMPT>" must be the LAST argument
   216	agy --model gemini-3.6-flash --effort <low|medium|high> \
   217	  --add-dir <repo> --print-timeout 5m -p "<PROMPT>" < /dev/null
   218	```
   219	
   220	### Verified behavior
   221	- **`-p` eats the next argument as the prompt.** A flag placed after `-p` becomes the prompt
   222	  *and the real task and model selection are silently dropped* (verified: fell back to the
   223	  default model, Claude Opus, and answered the flag text). Always put `-p "<PROMPT>"` last.
   224	- **No permission gate on ≥1.1.4**: headless runs read **and write** freely with no flags.
   225	  `--dangerously-skip-permissions` and `--mode accept-edits` are no longer required, and no
   226	  read-only tier exists. (On ≤1.1.1 headless auto-denied every tool — a total behavior flip
   227	  between patch releases; re-verify on every version bump.)
   228	- **Document-shaped tasks divert output**: "produce a document" prompts write the answer to
   229	  `~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/<conversation-id>/*.md` and print only a banner to stdout.
   230	  Mitigations, in order:
   231	  1. Always instruct: *"output your full answer inline as your final message; do not write any file."*
   232	  2. If stdout is banner-only, sweep before declaring failure:
   233	     ```bash
   234	     find ~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain -name '*.md' -mmin -10 \
   235	       -not -path '*/.system_generated/*' | xargs ls -t | head -1
   236	     ```
   237	     Use `-mmin`, **not** `-newermt '-10 minutes'` — that form silently matches nothing.
   238	- Exit codes normal on ≥1.1.4 (0 success, 1 error). Bogus model → clean error listing all
   239	  available models.
   240	- **Model naming**: display label verbatim (`"Gemini 3.6 Flash (Low)"`) or slug
   241	  (`gemini-3.6-flash-low`) both accepted. Effort: baked into the name **or** base slug +
   242	  `--effort low|medium|high`; combining `--effort` with an effort-suffixed name **errors**
   243	  (`--effort is not supported for model "Gemini 3.5 Flash"` — labels always carry effort).
   244	- **Auth is OAuth**: run `agy` once interactively (creds → `~/.gemini/`); headless fails
   245	  *silently* when signed out.
   246	- `< /dev/null` mandatory (hang, as codex).
   247	- One prompt per turn — no conversation batching in print mode; `--print-timeout` bounds the wait.
