    38	
    39	**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**
    40	- Same session (no context switch)
    41	- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)
    42	- Review after each task (spec compliance + code quality), broad review at the end
    43	- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)
